cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SeFCM & Sw-SSFCM — reference implementation
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  accompanying paper listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Xuan Hoang
  - family-names: Mai
    given-names: Dinh Sinh
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Long Giang
repository-code: https://github.com/longlinh/Sw-SSFCM_Algs
abstract: >-
  NumPy reference implementation of SeFCM (Fuzzy C-Means with softmax
  cross-entropy guidance) and Sw-SSFCM (SeFCM extended with spatial
  neighbourhood weighting), together with scripts that reproduce the
  hyperspectral image clustering experiments reported in the accompanying
  paper.
keywords:
  - fuzzy c-means
  - semi-supervised clustering
  - hyperspectral imaging
  - remote sensing
  - spatial weighting
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-07-21'
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    A novel approach to spatial-weighted semi-supervised fuzzy c-means
    clustering for hyperspectral image analysis
  authors:
    - family-names: Nguyen
      given-names: Xuan Hoang
    - family-names: Mai
      given-names: Dinh Sinh
    - family-names: Nguyen
      given-names: Long Giang
  journal: Computers and Geosciences
  year: 2026
  notes: Under review. DOI to be assigned on acceptance.
